#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-iPod-Lyrics-Downloader.php:4
#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/MiniLyrics_help.php:11
#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/MiniLyrics_help.php:38
msgid "Lyrics Downloader for iPod"
msgstr "iPod 歌词下载"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-iPod-Lyrics-Downloader.php:10
msgid "Show lyrics on iPod Touch using Lyrics Downloader for iPod"
msgstr "使用 iPod 歌词下载程序在 iPod 上显示歌词"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-iPod-Lyrics-Downloader.php:11
msgid ""
"MiniLyrics could save lyrics in song files in bulk, then you can use iTunes "
"to sync them to your iPod Touch or iPhone."
msgstr ""
"MiniLyrics 可以批量下载并且保存歌词到您的 MP3 文件中，您可以在iPod 和 iPhone "
"上查看。"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-iPod-Lyrics-Downloader.php:13
msgid ""
"Switch to 'Lyrics Downloader for iPod' by clicking right mouse button on "
"MiniLyrics window."
msgstr "在 MiniLyrics 窗口中，通过点击鼠标右键，切换到 iPod 歌词下载。"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-iPod-Lyrics-Downloader.php:15
msgid ""
"In Lyrics Downloader for iPod, click menu item '<b>Import iTunes Library</"
"b>'."
msgstr "在 iPod 歌词下载程序中，点击菜单项‘<b>导入 iTunes 媒体库</b>’。"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-iPod-Lyrics-Downloader.php:18
msgid ""
"Then click menu item '<b>Download All Lyrics for iPod</b>'. MiniLyrics will "
"save all lyrics in media files."
msgstr ""
"然后点击菜单 &quot;<b>为 iPod 下载所有歌词</b>&quot;. MiniLyrics 会保存所有歌"
"词到媒体文件中."

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-iPod-Lyrics-Downloader.php:19
msgid ""
"Or you can click menu item '<b>Advanced > Download All Lyrics...</b>', there "
"are more advanced options to download lyrics."
msgstr ""

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-iPod-Lyrics-Downloader.php:21
msgid ""
"Plug in your iPod, and all the changed media files with lyrics will be "
"synchronized to your iPod."
msgstr "插入您的 iPod，然后所有改变的媒体文件和歌词会自动被同步到 iPod 中。"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-logitech-lcd.php:3
