#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/MiniLyrics_help.php:44
msgid "How do I display lyrics on Logitech G15 keyboard LCD?"
msgstr "如果在 Logitech G15 键盘的 LCD 上显示歌词？"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-logitech-lcd.php:9
msgid ""
"MiniLyrics supports display lyrics on Logitech G15 \n"
"\tLCD, just install MiniLyrics, and press the button below to switch to "
"MiniLyrics."
msgstr ""
"MiniLyrics 支持在 Logitech G15 键盘的 LCD 上显示歌词，只要您安装 MiniLyrics，"
"然后按下如下图所示的按钮切换到 MiniLyrics。"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-lyrscrollaction.php:3
#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-lyrscrollaction.php:9
#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/MiniLyrics_help.php:52
msgid "How do I control the scrolling of text lyrics?"
msgstr "如果控制文本歌词的滚动？"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-lyrscrollaction.php:10
msgid ""
"MiniLyrics could record and replay the scrolling action of text lyrics. You "
"can just scroll lyrics with your keyboard or mouse wheel, and MiniLyrics "
"will record them and replay them next time."
msgstr ""
"MiniLyrics 能够记录和重放文本歌词的滚动动作。您只要使用键盘或者鼠标滚轮滚动歌"
"词，MiniLyrics 就会记录他们，然后在下次重放。"

#: F:\Web\Crintsoft.com_PHP/help-lyrscrollaction.php:11
msgid "The UI below will be showed up when you have .TXT lyrics opened."
msgstr "当您打开.txt 歌词时，下面的界面会显示出来。"

